WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:34.000
This is 99% Invisible. I'm Roman Mars. On the evening of May 31st, 2009, 216 passengers, three pilots, and nine flight attendants boarded an air-france flight in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. The flight was headed across the Atlantic Ocean to Paris. A warning. This story might not be a good one to listen to if you're sitting on a plane right now. That's producer Katie Mingle letting you know that the closest exit could be behind you. The plane that took off that evening from Rio was an Airbus 330.
这里是 99% Invisible。我是罗曼·马尔斯。2009年5月31日晚上，216名乘客、三名飞行员和九名乘务员在巴西里约热内卢登上一架法国航空公司（Air France）的航班。这架飞机正飞往大西洋对岸的巴黎。有个警告。如果你现在正坐在飞机上，这个故事可能不太适合听。这是节目制作人凯蒂·明格尔（Katie Mingle）在提醒你，最近的安全出口可能就在你身后。那天晚上从里约起飞的飞机是一架空中客车 A330。

2
