A plane that even the worst pilots could fly with ease. Bernard Ziegler, he famously said that he was building an airplane that his calls Sierge could fly. Ziegler's plane not only had autopilot, it also had what's called a fly-by-wire system. So this can get a bit technical, but basically an autopilot just does what a pilot tells it to do. Fly-by-wire is a computer-based control system that can interpret what the pilot wants to do and then do it smoothly and safely. So if the pilot pulls
一架即使是最差的飞行员也能轻松驾驶的飞机。伯纳德·齐格勒，他曾有一句名言：他正在制造一架他的礼宾员（concierge）都能飞的飞机。齐格勒的飞机不仅有自动驾驶仪，还有所谓的电传操纵（fly-by-wire）系统。所以这可能会变得有点技术性，但基本上自动驾驶仪只是做飞行员告诉它要做的事。电传操纵是一个基于计算机的控制系统，可以解释飞行员想要做什么，然后平稳安全地完成它。所以如果飞行员拉动

