back on his or her stick, the fly-by-wire system will say, oh, I see that you want to pitch up and here, I'll do it for you at just the right angle and rate. Importantly, the fly-by-wire system will also protect you from getting into an aerodynamic stall. So in a car, a stall happens when the engine stops turning, but in a plane, stalling is different. Basically getting so slow that the wing's no longer function correctly and the airplane loses altitude, put it that way. A stall in a plane can happen when the nose of the plane is pitched up at two steep and
他或她的操纵杆，电传操纵系统会说，哦，我看到你想抬头，来吧，我以恰好的角度和速率为你完成。重要的是，电传操纵系统还可以保护你免于进入气动失速状态。所以在汽车里，失速发生在发动机停止转动时，但在飞机上，失速是不同的。基本上就是速度变得太慢，以至于机翼不再正常工作，飞机失去高度，换句话说。当机鼻抬得太高而导致飞机失速时，

