00:07:33.000 --> 00:08:02.000
This design variation may also have contributed to what was about to become a very bad situation. In any case, as the pilot in the right seat pulled back on his stick, the airplane pulled its nose up and started to soar upward. When stall protections are in place, the plane won't just warn you not to pitch it at such an extreme angle, it physically will not let you do it. But remember, the plane had shifted into a mode in which it wasn't offering that underlying protection.
